# Zero the referee's metrics and start a new run.
#
# This does NOT move the vehicle. Resetting the WORLD is dsim_simctl's job
# (/sim/control with command RESET); the referee notices that on its own,
# because simulated time goes backwards -- see dsim_time/sim_epoch.hpp. This
# service exists for the other case: starting a fresh scoring run without
# disturbing a flight that is already in the air.
---
bool success
string message
